# devices/akita/drivers/power/conf: the Pixel 8a's own power drivers (docs/drivers-config.md, docs/porting/drivers.md).

driver AKITA_BATTERY
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.akita_battery.c
	requires BATTERY
	help    the Pixel 8a's battery and charger state: the MAX77759's fuel gauge and charger over zuma's hsi2c@10cb0000,
	help    polled every 5 s and given to HakiosBattery, Darwin's power source (fuelgauge=1); read only
